 * mirrors it for the consumer information sheet: sign + sheet to the employer
 * or building manager; the employer posts >=48h ahead in an area of common
 * access EMPLOYEES ARE MOST LIKELY TO SEE, and makes the sheet available on
 * request during NORMAL BUSINESS HOURS. §7.148(b) is the posting duty.
 * A retail premises SELLING FOOD is additionally caught by Health & Safety
 * Code §341.011(3) — "a restaurant, food market, bakery, other place of
 * business ... in which food is prepared, packed, stored, transported, sold,
 * or served to the public and that is not constantly maintained in a sanitary
